%\[c_{d,\delta,k,i}\ \;R_{u}(F_0,\ldots,F_n)=R_{v}(R_{w_{0}}(F_0,\ldots,F_n),\ldots
%,R_{w_{n}}(F_0,\ldots,F_n))\]
