To assess the sequence diversity, we visualized CDR-H3 embeddings using AntiBERTy (Fig. \ref{fig:phase1-screening}B). \texttt{MEAN} variants formed a tight, isolated cluster, while \texttt{ESM-IF} and \texttt{SaProt} occupied broader, partially overlapping regions—indicating greater diversity.
