    \caption{\textbf{Bridge score identifies semantically aligned concept pairs across modalities.} Even though most concepts are unimodal in activation, many form meaningful connections across modalities via the bridge score. Edges connect concept pairs that are both geometrically aligned and co-activated on paired examples. These links often reflect many-to-many relationships between clusters of related concepts, enabling cross-modal alignment despite sparse unimodal structure.}
    \label{fig:bridge-viz}
\end{figure}

