\section{Discussion and Conclusion}
%\vspace{-2mm}
%We analyze the linear structure of vision-language embedding spaces using SAEs trained on four state-of-the-art VLMs. Our results highlight the importance of \textbf{energy}: while the full set of learned concepts is sensitive to seeds and data mixtures, the high-energy subset is consistently recovered and accounts for nearly all reconstruction.
