        & thin & 1.41 & 骁勇 (valiant), 端庄 (dignified), 坚毅 (persevering), 刚毅 (resolute), 刚强 (strong), 倔强 (stubborn), 妩媚 (charming), 雍容 (graceful), 耿直 (honest), 豪爽 (generous) \\
