We showcase the effectiveness of each Shapley estimator in practice, reporting a comparison between the best performing distribution in \cref{fig:low_dimensional_experiments} (1, with replacement; 2 without replacement).
The clearest separations across methods appears in the comparison between matrix-vector and least squares estimators.
