We find that $\ell_2$ squared, modified $\ell_2$, and the kernel distribution perform comparably. (\cref{fig:low_dimensional_experiments} (1,2)) $\ell_2$ squared outperforming $\ell_2$ modified marginally and outperforming kernel more significantly in both least squares and matrix-vector approximations.
