    \caption{Decoding \glspl{ber} and \glspl{fer} for a polar code with rate $1.6$ bits per base on real DNA Nanopore data, shown as a function of the average number of traces per strand ($\lambda$) and the number of strands per codeword ($N_0$).}
    \label{fig:combined-plots}
