\section{Conclusions}
\label{sec:conclusions}

We derived \emph{a posteriori} error estimates for the Stabilization-Free
Virtual Element Method defined in \cite{Berrone2024a,BBFM2025}. The abscence of
a stabilizing bilinear form in the discretization method allows to obtain
equivalence between a suitably defined error measure and classical residual
error estimators. Numerical tests on several mesh types validate the proposed
error estimator.

