To fairly investigate the world knowledge of LLMs, we propose \textit{MMLU-CF}, a contamination-free multiple-choice question benchmark for LLMs. To minimize the risk of benchmark exposure and contamination, we perform five key processing steps for the data: (1) MCQ Collection, (2) MCQ Cleaning, (3) Difficulty Sampling, (4) LLMs Checking, (5) Contamination-Free Processing.
