\label{sec:innovations}
The proposed methodology has been applied to innovation topics explored in RESTART, specifically \glspl{mpn} and \gls{ndt}, to translate research outcomes into potential 6G standardization contributions. This section provides an overview of these two key innovations, highlighting their concepts, technical characteristics, and applications.
